A busy [service](/lore/services-capture-dependencies) needs a way to reject incoming work. Callers must respect its signal instead of immediately amplifying the same overload.

Book basis: [B4](/lore/durability-bibliography#b4-release-it), [B12](/lore/durability-bibliography#b12-site-reliability-engineering).

## Failure it prevents

An overloaded service keeps accepting work and extends its own outage.

## Our Effect 4.0.0 reading

`Queue` and `Semaphore` offer local capacity controls. They do not choose the ingress response or implement caller cooperation. Model overload modes explicitly when needed.

Source: `packages/effect/src/Queue.ts`, `packages/effect/src/Semaphore.ts`.

## How to check

Exceed capacity. Observe a truthful refusal or durable deferral, bounded backlog, and recovery after demand falls. This check is our proposal. The books do not prescribe it.

Continue with [Retry load needs a budget](/lore/retry-load-needs-a-budget), [Backpressure reaches the producer](/lore/backpressure-reaches-the-producer).

Connect this to [the existing rat-stack guidance](/lore/concurrent-work-needs-an-owner).

